%% Bonus B2: a tool with needs_approval=True. The first Runner.run stops with the proposed call;
%% the tool runs only inside the second Runner.run, which takes the saved state.
%% Lime notes: the steps our code or a person takes between the two runs.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i approval_pause.mmd -o approval_pause.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Our code
    participant R as Runner
    participant M as Model
    participant T as Tool
    C->>R: Runner.run(agent, request)
    R->>M: request
    M-->>R: tool call (name, arguments)
    R-->>C: the pending call
    Note over C,R: the tool has not run yet<br/>a person reads the call<br/>state.approve(item)<br/>or state.reject(item)
    C->>R: Runner.run(agent, state)
    R->>T: approved: run the tool
    T-->>R: the tool's result
    R->>M: result, or rejection message
    M-->>R: reply
    R-->>C: result.final_output
